    "['no shutdown', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 disable false\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 disable false\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. `no shutdown` is equivalent to `disable false`\\n2. Juniper requires interface units and families to be configured (here using `ethernet-switching` for layer 2)\\n3. I included both interfaces (ge-1/0/0 and ge-2/0/0) for completeness, though the original request was for a single command translation. The core equivalent is `disable false` for `no shutdown`.', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/0 disable false', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 disable false\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 disable false\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. `no shutdown` is equivalent to `disable false`\\n2. Juniper requires interface units and families to be configured (here using `ethernet-switching` for layer 2)\\n3. I included both interfaces (ge-1/0/0 and ge-2/0/0) for completeness, though the original request was for a single command translation. The core equivalent is `disable false` for `no shutdown`.', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/0 disable false'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 disable false\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 disable false\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. `no shutdown` is equivalent to `disable false`\\n2. Juniper requires interface units and families to be configured (here using `ethernet-switching` for layer 2)\\n3. I included both interfaces (ge-1/0/0 and ge-2/0/0) for completeness, though the original request was for a single command translation. The core equivalent is `disable false` for `no shutdown`.', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-2/0/0 disable false', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 disable false\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 disable false\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. `no shutdown` is equivalent to `disable false`\\n2. Juniper requires interface units and families to be configured (here using `ethernet-switching` for layer 2)\\n3. I included both interfaces (ge-1/0/0 and ge-2/0/0) for completeness, though the original request was for a single command translation. The core equivalent is `disable false` for `no shutdown`.', 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-2/0/0 disable false'}]]": 1,
